{"uid":"99c8923157dd6a1f","name":"test_early_plugin_that_already_imported_a_regular_package_decoy_is_displaced","fullName":"tests.test_tests_conftest_resolution#test_early_plugin_that_already_imported_a_regular_package_decoy_is_displaced","historyId":"711ef3ef9ad5374014b045090ee5f0cf","time":{"start":1791931150057,"stop":1791931151808,"duration":1751},"description":"Worse than injecting a `sys.path` entry: the early plugin *imports*\n    the decoy, so by the time `/conftest.py` runs, `sys.modules` already\n    holds a foreign `tests` **and** a foreign `tests.conftest`. No amount\n    of `sys.path` or `__path__` work helps then -- `sys.modules` is\n    consulted first -- so `/conftest.py` has to detect that the bound\n    `tests` is not ours, replace it, and purge the stale `tests.*`\n    children it seeded.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Worse than injecting a <code>sys.path</code> entry: the early plugin <em>imports</em><br />\nthe decoy, so by the time <code>/conftest.py</code> runs, <code>sys.modules</code> already<br />\nholds a foreign <code>tests</code> <strong>and</strong> a foreign <code>tests.conftest</code>. No amount<br />\nof <code>sys.path</code> or <code>__path__</code> work helps then -- <code>sys.modules</code> is<br />\nconsulted first -- so <code>/conftest.py</code> has to detect that the bound<br />\n<code>tests</code> is not ours, replace it, and purge the stale <code>tests.*</code><br />\nchildren it seeded.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791930548296,"stop":1791930548296,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791930548296,"stop":1791930548296,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachment